{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33346","headline":"榆溪道上 · 欧阳玭","name":"榆溪道上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初日在斜溪，山云片片低。\n乡愁梦里失，马色望中迷。\n涧底凄泉气，岩前遍绿荑。\n非关秦塞去，无事候晨鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳玭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}